      "blocks": {
        "photo1": {
          "type": "photo_review",
          "settings": {
            "body": "I have tried several brands of grips socks. The grip wears off, my toes slip and my Pilates form suffers. Since I have started use the barreletics grip shoes, those days are gone. I know have more confidence in my poses and the grip is consistent. Not to mention they are easy to put on and easy to wash. The mesh bag that they come in is very useful. It is big enough to hold my grip gloves for easy storing and transportation to class.",
            "author": "Leslie S.",
            "location": "Katy, US",
            "rating": 5,
            "image_url": "https://review-images.judgeme.com/barreletics/1780166108__img_3722__original.jpeg?quality=80&width=1024"
          }
        },
        "photo2": {
          "type": "photo_review",
          "settings": {
            "body": "These grippy shoes are the best most comfortable footwear for my barre and palates classes. I love them",
            "author": "B P.",
            "location": "Philadelphia, US",
            "rating": 5,
            "image_url": "https://review-images.judgeme.com/barreletics/1778161226__9063__original.jpg?quality=80&width=1024"
          }
        },
        "photo3": {
          "type": "photo_review",
          "settings": {
            "body": "All grip and no slip, i love them i have neuropathy in my feet and cant keep grip socks on they slide off this is the best grip for me. I love them. I got open sole perfect fit.",
            "author": "Tracie",
            "rating": 5,
            "image_url": "https://review-images.judgeme.com/barreletics/1774811582__img_9994__original.jpeg?quality=80&width=1024"
          }
        },
        "text1": {
          "type": "text_review",
          "settings": {
            "body": "I am a full-time Barre instructor and teach on a variety of surfaces and mats \u2014 these provide the perfect level of grip and support and fit like a glove. YES! Finally a good durable barre shoe!",
            "author": "Laura P.",
            "location": "Sacramento, US \u00b7 Barre instructor",
            "rating": 5
          }
        },
        "text2": {
          "type": "text_review",
          "settings": {
            "body": "A long time void that was begging for a solution! Genius concept. Simple, effective, stylish \u2014 I can improve my workout 10 fold without the nagging sock slippage and constant adjustment.",
            "author": "Jess",
            "location": "Ashburn, US",
            "rating": 5
          }
        },
        "text3": {
          "type": "text_review",
          "settings": {
            "body": "After almost a year off the foot bar due to my neuropathy, I am confidently back to the footwork series in Pilates!",
            "author": "JenB",
            "location": "Millville, US",
            "rating": 5
          }
        },
        "text4": {
          "type": "text_review",
          "settings": {
            "body": "I was looking for a 'good' pair of Pilates socks and came across what I thought was a ridiculously priced alternative. I sat on the idea for a couple of weeks but finally decided to take the plunge. After my first class\u2026 [game changer].",
            "author": "Wendy B.",
            "location": "Grayslake, US",
            "rating": 5
          }
        },
        "text5": {
          "type": "text_review",
          "settings": {
            "body": "I was dreading going back to Pilates after a spinal fusion because I felt like grip socks were not going to cut it. I had never found a pair of grip socks that wouldn't slip a bit while doing bridges on the chair or reformer so I started looking for something that would help alleviate my fears.",
            "author": "Samantha B.",
            "location": "Castle Rock, US",
            "rating": 5
          }
        },
        "text6": {
          "type": "text_review",
          "settings": {
            "body": "This is the second pair I'm buying. Love them sooo much, got a lot of use out of it and I bought a third. Lasted me a year, used it almost every day!",
            "author": "Catherine R.",
            "location": "Lanham, US",
            "rating": 5
          }
        }
      },
